          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(11)  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 \\times"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  SDS PAGE 样品缓冲液:0.2mol/L Tris-HCl，pH6.8，8% (w/V) SDS，40% (V/V) 甘油，5% (V/V) β-巯基乙醇，0.4% (w/V) 溴酚蓝。要配 50ml，从 1mol/L Tris-HCl 溶液中取 10ml，pH6.8，SDS 4g，20ml 甘油，2.5ml β-巯基乙醇，0.2g 溴酚蓝。加蒸馏水定容至 50ml。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.201,
            0.193,
            0.218
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 步骤"
            }
