          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.222,
            0.902,
            0.283
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）挑选一个转化了含目的 cDNA 的 pYEXbx 质粒的酿酒酵母 AH22ura3 的单克隆，接种到含有 40mg/L 组氨酸的 20ml EM VIII 培养基中（100ml 摇瓶中），于 28℃ 摇床（200r/min）培养过夜做预培养。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.286,
            0.901,
            0.325
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 取 1ml 预培养物，接种到含有 40mg/L 组氨酸的 100ml EM VIII 培养基中 (500ml 摇瓶中)，28℃ 摇床（200r/min）培养 16～24h，直到  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "OD_{600}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  为 7～10。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.328,
            0.9,
            0.368
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）加入  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100 \\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  0.5 mol/L 的  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "CuSO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  （0.5 mmol/L 终浓度）诱导蛋白质表达， "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "28^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  摇床培养 3～4 h。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.371,
            0.802,
            0.389
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 取 7~10ml 菌液 ( "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "OD_{600}=70"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " )，离心 (10min, 2500g, 4℃) 收集。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.392,
            0.732,
            0.41
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 加入 5ml 冷的 PBS，重新悬浮沉淀。重复离心后，弃上清。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.414,
            0.891,
            0.432
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 在干的冰乙醇或者液氮中冰冻上述洗涤过的细胞，或者把细胞贮存在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-70^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.435,
            0.903,
            0.475
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（7）在室温下解冻细胞，加入  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "300 \\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  预冷的裂解缓冲液，重悬细胞，加  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 \\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  100mmol/L 的 PMSF 贮存液（终浓度为 1mmol/L）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.478,
            0.904,
            0.517
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（8）加等体积的无菌且酸洗过的玻璃珠（0.5mm），全速振荡1min后在冰上冷冻1min，重复7次以破碎细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.52,
            0.904,
            0.56
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(9) 10 000g, 4℃，离心裂解液 15～20min，以去除细胞碎片，把上清液转到干净的试管中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.563,
            0.905,
            0.646
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（10）取样  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，加  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "   "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4\\times"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  SDS-PAGE 样品缓冲液，在  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "95^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  加热样品 5min，在  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-20^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  贮存以便 SDS-PAGE 和免疫印迹法分析。注意:由于重组蛋白只占一小部分，所以不能从电泳染色后的总酵母蛋白中直接检测重组目的基因的产物。而是需要从原提取物中纯化重组蛋白，或者通过免疫印迹来检测，见（四）。"
            }
